{"title":"Career roadmap — Brand Activation Manager","role":"Brand Activation Manager","summary":"A Brand Activation Manager plans and executes marketing experiences that make consumers interact directly with a brand. This includes events, experiential campaigns, product launches, pop-ups, campus activations, retail experiences, sponsorships, influencer activities and on-ground campaigns.","facts":{"Current degree":"BHM / B.Sc Hospitality & Hotel Administration / BTTM","Course":"Event Management"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["The role sits at the intersection of event management","marketing","brand strategy","consumer experience","production","analytics."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build event execution, marketing, consumer behaviour, vendor management and experiential-design skills; enter as Event/Brand Activation Executive."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Progress to Brand Activation Manager, Experiential Marketing Manager or Account Manager."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Lead large campaigns, national activations, brand experiences and strategic client accounts."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move into Head of Experiential Marketing, Brand Experience Director, Marketing Director or independent activation agency leadership."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Marketing + event foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing fundamentals"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Branding"},{"text":"Event management"},{"text":"Public relations"},{"text":"Advertising fundamentals"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Hospitality operations"},{"text":"Basic budgeting"},{"text":"Sales fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},